{"abstract":[{"text":"Setup a single or a set of tracker instances which will be used inside the app to track events.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"remoteConfiguration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/RemoteConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPRemoteConfiguration","text":"RemoteConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultConfiguration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultBundles","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationBundle","text":"ConfigurationBundle","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPConfigurationBundle","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultConfigurationVersion","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultBundleVersion","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = NSInteger.min, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onSuccess","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ([","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationState","text":"ConfigurationState","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"remoteConfiguration","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The remote configuration used to indicate where to download the configuration from.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"defaultBundles","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default configuration passed by default in case there isn’t a cached version and it’s able to download a new one."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"defaultBundleVersion","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Version of the default configuration that will be used to compare with the fetched remote config to decide whether to replace it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"onSuccess","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The callback called when a configuration (cached or downloaded) is set.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It passes two arguments: list of the namespaces associated to the created trackers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the state of the configuration – whether it was retrieved from cache or fetched over the network.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The app can run multiple tracker instances which will be identified by string ","type":"text"},{"code":"namespaces","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The trackers configuration is automatically download from the endpoint indicated in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"RemoteConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passed as argument. For more details see ","type":"text"},{"code":"RemoteConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The method is asynchronous and you can receive the list of the created trackers in the callbacks once the trackers are created.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The callback can be called multiple times in case a cached configuration is ready and later a fetched configuration is available.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can also pass as argument a default configuration in case there isn’t a cached configuration and it’s not able to download","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a new one. The downloaded configuration updates the cached one only if the configuration version is greater than the cached one.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise the cached one is kept and the callback is not called.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: The EventStore will persist all the events that have been tracked but not yet sent."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Those events are attached to the namespace."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the tracker is removed or the app relaunched with a different namespace, those events can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be sent to the collector and they remain in a zombie state inside the EventStore."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To remove all the zombie events you can call an internal method "},{"code":"removeUnsentEventsExceptForNamespaces","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"code":"SPSQLEventStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which will delete all the EventStores instanced with namespaces not listed in the passed list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow\/setup(remoteConfiguration:defaultConfiguration:defaultConfigurationVersion:onSuccess:)"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadat